@host = https://localhost:7124

### GET With API Key (200)
GET {{host}}/api/Tickets
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: anything

### GET Without API Key (401)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/
Accept: application/json

### OpenApi Document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: anything

### Unknown URL
GET {{host}}/api/get-a-free-iphone
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: anything

### GET by ID 0 (400)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/0
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: anything

### GET by ID -1 (400)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/-1
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: anything

### GET by ID 1 (200)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/1
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: anything

### GET Diagnostics (operation ID)
GET {{host}}/api/Diagnostics
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: anything